<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-CRITERIUM INTERNATIONAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-CRITERIUM INTERNATIONAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>RABASTENS, France 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading placings in</p>
<p>the 188-km first stage of the Criterium International cycle race</p>
<p>from Blaye-les-Mines on Saturday:</p>
<p>1. Stephane Barthe (France) Casino    4 hours 47 minutes and</p>
<p>28 seconds</p>
<p>2. Mario Traversoni (Italy) Mercatone Uno</p>
<p>3. Frederic Moncassin (France) GAN</p>
<p>4. Gordon Fraser (Canada) Mutuelle Seine-et-Marne</p>
<p>5. Marco Villa (Italy) Brescialat</p>
<p>6. Laurent Jalabert (France) ONCE</p>
<p>7. Nicolas Jalabert (France) Cofidis</p>
<p>8. Martin Hvastija (Slovakia) Cantina Tollo</p>
<p>9. Mirco Crepaldi (Italy) Polti</p>
<p>10. Marco Artunghi (Italy) Mercatone Uno    same time as Barthe</p>
</text>
